{
  "id": "31923_meiru",
  "headword": "{滅入|めい}る",
  "reading": "めいる",
  "romaji": "meiru",
  "part_of_speech": "verb (godan)",
  "gloss": "to feel depressed; to be dispirited",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to feel depressed; to be dispirited; to feel low",
      "explanation": "For one's mood or spirits to sink. Almost always in the phrase {気|き}が{滅入|めい}る."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "31923_meiru_ex1",
      "japanese": "⟦{気|き}→気：02199_ki⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{滅入|めい}る。",
      "english": "I feel down.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": true,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "31923_meiru_ex2",
      "japanese": "⟦{雨|あめ}→雨：00583_ame⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦{続|つづ}く→続く：00903_tsuzuku⟧⟦と→と：00512_to⟧⟦{気|き}→気：02199_ki⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{滅入|めい}る。",
      "english": "Day after day of rain gets me down.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": true,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "31923_meiru_ex3",
      "japanese": "⟦{暗|くら}い→暗い：00647_kurai⟧⟦ニュース→ニュース：04437_nyuusu⟧⟦ばかり→〜ばかり：02006_bakari⟧⟦{見|み}ている→見る：00283_miru⟧⟦と→と：00512_to⟧、⟦だんだん→だんだん：00832_dandan⟧⟦{気|き}→気：02199_ki⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{滅入|めい}ってくる。",
      "english": "Watching nothing but grim news gradually wears my spirits down.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": true,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY:\nIntransitive; there is no transitive counterpart.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{気|き}→気：02199_ki⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{滅入|めい}る (to feel depressed): the usual form, with ⟦{気|き}→気：02199_ki⟧ as subject\n- ⟦{気|き}→気：02199_ki⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{滅入|めい}るような (depressing: ⟦{気|き}→気：02199_ki⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{滅入|めい}るような⟦{話|はなし}→話：01496_hanashi⟧)\n- ⟦{気|き}→気：02199_ki⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{滅入|めい}ってくる (to become gradually more dispirited)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{落|お}ち{込|こ}む→落ち込む：05750_ochikomu⟧: to feel down, more often after a setback\n- ⟦{憂鬱|ゆううつ}→憂鬱：05821_yuuutsu⟧: gloomy, depressed (na-adjective); ⟦{気|き}→気：02199_ki⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{滅入|めい}る is more often caused by surroundings such as weather or news",
